#: ../../source/outgoing/api_transformers.rst:238
msgid "Transforming Objects"
msgstr "객체 변형"

#: ../../source/outgoing/api_transformers.rst:240
msgid "Any object can be cast to an array and transformed:"
msgstr "모든 객체를 배열로 캐스팅하고 변환할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/outgoing/api_transformers.rst:245
msgid "Using toArray() Only"
msgstr "toArray()만 사용"

#: ../../source/outgoing/api_transformers.rst:247
msgid ""
"If you don't pass a resource to ``transform()``, it will use the data from "
